  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Infraestructura Empresas Lecheras</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Infrastructure Dairy Enterprises</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TO IMPROVE THE PRODUCTIVE EFFICIENCY OF DAIRY FARMS IN THE LITORAL-WEST AND CENTRAL- SOUTH AREAS: SALTO,PAYSANDU,RIO NEGRO,SORIANO,DURAZNO,FLORES- AND THE EXPORT POTENTIAL OF THE SUBSECTOR, THROUGH INVESTMENTS IN RURAL ELECTRICITY AND ROADS,THAT ALLOW PRODUCERS TO ADOPT MECHANICAL MILKING AND REFRIGERATED TANKS THAT RESULT IN PRODUCTIVITY INCREASES AND REDUCTION IN PRODUCTION AND TRANSPORTATION COSTS.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
